        "dgtlmoon/changedetection.io:changedetectionio/content_fetchers/requests.py"
      ],
      "local_design": "Store per-host not-before state. Honor Retry-After on429/503, use bounded exponential backoff on eligible transient failures, avoid immediate retries for identity/parse/invalidURL errors, keep failed attempts out of price observations and do not bypass manual/forced checks. Schedule rather than sleep in the worker."
    },
    {
      "priority": 2,
      "name": "Source health and recovery visibility",
      "basis": [
