        "dgtlmoon/changedetection.io:changedetectionio/worker.py"
      ],
      "local_design": "Expose consecutive failures, failure category and next allowed retry time. Recovery clears failure state only after a verified successful quote; failures never imply restock or new-low and must not erase good historical observations."
    },
