      ],
      "local_design": "Use a separately configured browser fetcher only for an otherwise supported public retailer page that requires JavaScript; preserve proxy/TLS and URL/redirect restrictions. Feed rendered HTML into our exact-SKU parser; browser availability alone does not justify replacing working HTTP collection or bypassing access restrictions."
    }
